  "specialRules": [
    "Pas de Charge: French infantry are Reliable (+1 Command) in Attack Column, or a mixed formation Attack Column with skirmishers.",
    "Sharpshooters: Light infantry can re-roll one missed shot per turn.",
    "Skirmish: only Light infantry can adopt skirmish formation; other troops only to enter terrain they couldn't otherwise, or as part of a mixed formation.",
    "Marauders: French Chasseurs à Cheval ignore the distance penalty when given orders.",
    "Heavy Cavalry D1: Dragoons add one to any combat result, rather than between one and three.",
    "All French infantry: Pas de Charge, Must Form Square, Mixed Formation, and can form skirmish order in terrain they couldn't normally enter."
  ]
}
